mission "The False Beacon"
    name "The False Beacon"
    description "Deliver the signal book to Mariner's Rest and speak with Captain Calderon."
    source "Blackwater Reach"
    destination "Mariner's Rest"
    reward 820
    speaker offer "Captain Ines Calderon"
    speaker visit "Captain Ines Calderon"
    speaker complete "Captain Ines Calderon"
    to offer
        has "A Fleet in Open Water: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `A false beacon has been lit on the coast, drawing merchant ships toward a dangerous reef.`
            `The Company hopes the wrecks will look like ordinary accidents. The pilot at Mariner's Rest knows the true beacon code and can expose the trick.`
            `Carry the recovered signal book to the pilot and help restore the proper channel lights.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `Carry the recovered signal book to the pilot and help restore the proper channel lights.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Ortez sends a fresh copy of the signal book. “A false light is a quiet weapon. Put the true one back where every sailor can see it.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The False Beacon. Deliver the signal book to Mariner's Rest and speak with Captain Calderon."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Calderon restores the beacon sequence. The true signals show Ashcombe moving toward Stormhaven to repair his flagship.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The free fleet must reach Stormhaven before the Meridian Star can be made ready.`
        log "Completed The False Beacon. Received 820 gold. The free fleet must reach Stormhaven before the Meridian Star can be made ready."
